<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <%- include('partials/head', { title: 'Help and contact - Terp Notes' }) %>
</head>
<body class="tn-app">
    <% const user = locals.user || null; %>
    <%- include('partials/publicnav', { user }) %>
    <% const v = (k) => (typeof locals[k] === 'string' ? locals[k] : ''); %>

    <main class="tn-prose" id="main">
        <h1>Help and contact</h1>
        <p class="tn-meta">Most answers are below. For anything else, send a message and a real Terp replies within a day or two.</p>

        <section class="tn-faq" aria-label="Common questions">
            <details>
                <summary>I didn't get the confirmation email</summary>
                <p>Check spam and any "Other" or "Promotions" tab, then wait a few minutes. Try to log in and use <strong>Resend the email</strong> on the page that appears.</p>
            </details>
            <details>
                <summary>I forgot my password</summary>
                <p>Use <a href="/forgot-password">Reset your password</a> with your UMD email. The link works for one hour.</p>
            </details>
            <details>
                <summary>Can I change my username?</summary>
                <p>No. Usernames are permanent so uploads stay accountable. You can change your name on your profile.</p>
            </details>
            <details>
                <summary>What files can I upload?</summary>
                <p>PDFs, Word, PowerPoint and Excel files, images, text and code files, and .zip archives, up to 100 MB each.</p>
            </details>
            <details>
                <summary>How do I report a file?</summary>
                <p>On the dashboard, open the ⋯ menu next to the file and choose <strong>Report</strong>. A moderator reviews every report.</p>
            </details>
            <details>
                <summary>Why can't I upload anymore?</summary>
                <p>A moderator set your account to view-only, usually after a policy issue. Send a message below to ask for a review.</p>
            </details>
            <details>
                <summary>Is Terp Notes part of UMD?</summary>
                <p>No. It's an independent, student-run site and isn't affiliated with or endorsed by the University of Maryland.</p>
            </details>
        </section>

        <h2 id="message">Send a message</h2>
        <% if (locals.error) { %><div class="tn-alert tn-alert-error" role="alert"><%= error %></div><% } %>
        <form action="/contact/submit" method="POST" class="tn-form" style="margin-top: 1rem;">
            <div class="tn-form-row">
                <label class="tn-label" for="name">Name
                    <input class="tn-input" type="text" id="name" name="name" required autocomplete="name"
                        <% if (user) { %>value="<%= `${user.firstname || ''} ${user.lastname || ''}`.trim() %>" readonly<% } else { %>value="<%= v('name') %>"<% } %> />
                </label>
                <label class="tn-label" for="email">Email
                    <input class="tn-input" type="email" id="email" name="email" required autocomplete="email" inputmode="email"
                        <% if (user) { %>value="<%= user.email %>" readonly<% } else { %>value="<%= v('email') %>"<% } %> />
                </label>
            </div>
            <label class="tn-label" for="subject">Topic
                <select class="tn-input" id="subject" name="subject" required>
                    <% const topics = [['', 'Choose a topic'], ['account', 'My account'], ['upload', 'Uploading files'], ['bug', 'Something is broken'], ['content', 'Report content'], ['feature', 'Idea or feature request'], ['other', 'Something else']]; %>
                    <% for (const [val, label] of topics) { %>
                        <option value="<%= val %>" <%= v('subject') === val && val ? 'selected' : '' %><%= val ? '' : ' disabled' %><%= !v('subject') && !val ? ' selected' : '' %>><%= label %></option>
                    <% } %>
                </select>
            </label>
            <label class="tn-label" for="message">Message
                <textarea class="tn-input" id="message" name="message" required rows="6" placeholder="What happened, and what did you expect? Include the course code or file name if it's about a file."><%= v('message') %></textarea>
            </label>
            <div><button type="submit" class="tn-btn tn-btn-primary tn-btn-lg">Send message</button></div>
        </form>

        <h2>Security or urgent issues</h2>
        <p>Email <a href="mailto:pmachre@terpmail.umd.edu">pmachre@terpmail.umd.edu</a> with your username and what you found.</p>
    </main>

    <%- include('partials/footer') %>
</body>
</html>
